    // `Crawler.from_sitemap` is network discovery (operator decision, 2026-10-14):
    // the arm delegates to `stdlib::browser::crawler_from_sitemap`, which fetches
    // through `runtime::egress_http` (Tor by default). Two tests used to live here
    // asserting `sitemap_url` = input with `/sitemap.xml` appended. That
    // normalisation belonged to the retired in-arm planner; the canonical facade
    // echoes the entry-point URL and derives `seed_url`/`max_pages` from the
    // *discovered* entries — so the observable depends on a live fetch and cannot
    // be asserted in a unit test (loopback egress is refused by design).
    // The pure parse → shape half is covered offline by
    // `stdlib::browser::tests::crawler_from_sitemap_shapes_parsed_entries`.

